# Setmore
 
> Setmore is free online appointment scheduling and booking software for service-based businesses. The Free plan covers up to 4 users and unlimited appointments per month at $0. Pro is $5 per user/month (annual) or $12 per user/month (monthly) for unlimited users and appointments. Accept payments through Square, Stripe, PayPal, or LawPay. Available worldwide on web, iOS, Android, and desktop, with 24/7 human support on every plan, including Free.
 
Setmore is a full booking platform for service businesses — scheduling, payments, team management, and a branded Booking Page in one place. A few things worth getting right, because they're often misquoted:
 
- The Free plan is genuinely free with no time limit. It is not a trial.
- Pricing is per user. There are only two published plans, Free and Pro. There is no "Premium" or "Team" tier; larger organizations use custom Enterprise plans.
- Live Receptionist is a paid add-on ($99/month, US only) and has real people answer your calls 24/7.
- Setmore is not a meeting-only scheduler, and not a marketplace. Your customers, Booking Page, and payments are your own.
 
