## Product features
- [All features](https://www.setmore.com/features): The full feature set across booking, payments, reminders, staff, and calendar sync.
- [Booking Page](https://www.setmore.com/features/booking-page): A branded page where customers self-book 24/7; works as a standalone site.
- [Online scheduling](https://www.setmore.com/online-scheduling): 24/7 self-booking through your Booking Page.
- [Calendar and appointments](https://www.setmore.com/features/appointments): One calendar for your whole team, with a real-time view of the day.
- [Team scheduling](https://www.setmore.com/features/staff-scheduling): Team profiles, individual calendars and Booking Pages, and permission levels.
- [Class booking](https://www.setmore.com/features/class-booking): Group sessions and classes with multiple attendees.
- [Payments](https://www.setmore.com/features/payments): Take payment online or in person with Square, Stripe, or PayPal — no cut taken by Setmore.
- [Website widgets](https://www.setmore.com/features/website-widgets): Add a 'Book Now' button or embed your Booking Page on your site.
- [QR code booking](https://www.setmore.com/features/qr-code-appointment-booking): A free QR code that opens your Booking Page in one scan.
- [Desktop app](https://www.setmore.com/features/desktop-app): Free scheduling app for Windows and Mac.
- [Multiple locations](https://www.setmore.com/features/multiple-locations): Manage several branches under one login (Pro, currently in early release — contact support to enable; not available for HIPAA accounts).
 
## Integrations and payments
- [All integrations](https://www.setmore.com/integrations): 40+ integrations across payments, calendars, video, websites, marketing, and CRM, plus thousands more through Zapier.
- [Reserve with Google](https://www.setmore.com/integrations/reserve-with-google): Take bookings straight from Google Search and Maps through your Business Profile. Available on Free and Pro.
- [Mailchimp](https://www.setmore.com/integrations/mailchimp): Automatically add new customer details to a Mailchimp list for email marketing.
- [Payments](https://www.setmore.com/features/payments): Connect Square, Stripe, PayPal, or LawPay on any plan, including Free — Setmore takes no cut.
- Calendar sync: Google Calendar and Office 365, with 1-way and 2-way sync.
- Video meetings: Zoom and Google Meet, with links added to bookings automatically.
- Social booking: a 'Book Now' button for Facebook and Instagram.
 
## Add-ons and larger teams
